title: "RDWG Research Data Infrastructure: Evidence Base and Recommendations"
authors:
  - family-names: Dennis
    given-names: Tim
    affiliation: "UCLA Library, Data Science Center"
abstract: >
  Evidence base and recommendations from the UCLA Research Data Working
  Group (RDWG), prepared to inform the One IT Research Working Group
  (2026). Includes a one-pager, slide deck, gaps analysis, risk patterns,
  UC policy landscape, and supporting bibliography.
